        600
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Contract verbs with stems ending in -εα- and -ρα-",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": "black square",
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 5,
      "bbox": [
        238,
        196,
        281,
        915
      ],
      "margin_number": 134,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "As in the future (116) an exception to this rule is verbs whose stems end in -εα- and -ρα-: the α of these verbs becomes long in the aorist.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 6,
      "bbox": [
        291,
        246,
        321,
        829
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "δράω ‘I do, act’ (α > ᾱ) → ἔδρᾱσα ‘I did, acted’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        334,
        246,
        348,
        560
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Verbs with stems ending in λ, μ, ν or ρ",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        357,
        196,
        400,
        915
      ],
      "margin_number": 135,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Verbs whose stems end in λ, μ, ν or ρ do not form their aorist by the addition of σ. The general rule is that:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 9,
      "bbox": [
        409,
        246,
        423,
        712
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(a) the aorist stem of these verbs is the same as the present;",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 10,
      "bbox": [
        426,
        246,
        442,
        869
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(b) but if the final vowel in the present stem is short, it lengthens, e.g.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 11,
      "bbox": [
        448,
        246,
        461,
        858
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "διαφθείρω ‘I destroy’ διαφθειρ- → διέφθειρα ‘I destroyed’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": "blue bullet",
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 12,
      "bbox": [
        464,
        246,
        477,
        856
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἀμύνω ‘I ward off’ ἀμυν- → ἠμῡνα ‘I warded off’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": "blue bullet",
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 13,
      "bbox": [
        480,
        246,
        493,
        853
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "μένω ‘I remain’ μειν- → ἔμεινα ‘I remained’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": "blue bullet",
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 14,
      "bbox": [
        504,
        246,
        547,
        916
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(Note that verbs of this type usually have an aorist stem that is different from the future stem: see 117.)",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "order": 15,
      "bbox": [
        568,
        195,
        584,
        298
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Augments",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 16,
      "bbox": [
        593,
        196,
        624,
        915
      ],
      "margin_number": 136,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The principles of augmentation are exactly the same as for the imperfect (see 104–5). Thus ἐ- is added to stems beginning in a consonant:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 17,
      "bbox": [
        638,
        219,
        650,
        373
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Consonant stems",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": "black square",
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 18,
      "bbox": [
        658,
        224,
        672,
        825
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "διώκω ‘I pursue’ διωξ- → ἐ-δίωξα ‘I pursued’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 19,
      "bbox": [
        675,
        224,
        688,
        833
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "κολάζω ‘I punish’ κολασ- → ἐ-κόλασα ‘I punished’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 20,
      "bbox": [
        701,
        246,
        715,
        354
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Vowel stems",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 21,
      "bbox": [
        724,
        196,
        739,
        865
      ],
      "margin_number": 137,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "When a stem begins in a vowel, this vowel lengthens where possible:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 22,
      "bbox": [
        748,
        246,
        762,
        836
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἀκούω ‘I hear’ ἀκουσ- → ἠ-κουσα ‘I heard’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 23,
      "bbox": [
        764,
        246,
        778,
        834
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἐρωτάω ‘I ask’ ἐρωτησ- → ἠ-ρώτησα ‘I asked’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 24,
      "bbox": [
        780,
        246,
        794,
        843
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "εύχομαι ‘I pray’ εὐξ- → η-ὐξά-μην ‘I prayed’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 25,
      "bbox": [
        796,
        246,
        810,
        856
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἡσυχάζω ‘I keep quiet’ ἡσυχασ- → ἡ-σύχασα ‘I became quiet’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 26,
      "bbox": [
        821,
        219,
        834,
        362
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Compound verbs",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": "black square",
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 27,
      "bbox": [
        843,
        196,
        873,
        915
      ],
      "margin_number": 138,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Remember that with compound verbs it is the stem which is augmented, not the prefix:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
